@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Get all expenses (with category)
GET {{host}}/expenses

### 2. Get expense 1
GET {{host}}/expenses/1

### 3. Add Movie night (category 4 = Fun)
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Movie night",
  "amount": 18,
  "categoryId": 4
}

### 4. Delete an expense that does not exist
DELETE {{host}}/expenses/99

### 5. After a restart: is Movie night really saved?
GET {{host}}/expenses/4
